{%- comment -%}
  Razorpay Affordability Widget — EMI, Cardless EMI, Pay Later and the live
  offers configured in your Razorpay Dashboard (Affordability). Razorpay renders
  its own UI inside the container, so it will not match the theme's fonts and
  colours; the wrapper below is ours, everything inside #razorpay-affordability-widget
  is theirs.

  The offer list is NOT editable here — it comes from your Razorpay account.

  Params:
    product (required) — used for the initial amount
    block   (required) — the `razorpay_offers` block (key_id, heading)

  Amount: Razorpay expects paise, and Shopify's `variant.price` is already in the
  currency's smallest unit, so it passes through 1:1 with no conversion.
  global.js re-renders the widget when the shopper picks a different variant.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign rzp_key = block.settings.key_id | strip
  assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
-%}

{%- if rzp_key != blank and variant.price > 0 -%}
  <div
    class="mt-8 border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-6"
    data-razorpay-affordability
    data-rzp-key="{{ rzp_key | escape }}"
    data-rzp-amount="{{ variant.price }}"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}
      <p class="mb-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-charcoal">{{ block.settings.heading }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
    <div id="razorpay-affordability-widget"></div>
  </div>

  <script src="https://cdn.razorpay.com/widgets/affordability/affordability.js" data-rzp-affordability-script defer></script>
{%- endif -%}
